Planning a wedding pulls together a handful of different trades: venue, catering, florals, furniture, photography and audio visual, each supplied by its own vendor with its own contract. This guide covers the essential items for wedding rentals in Malaga across those trades, then draws a clear line around the one slice Malaga Event Gear (MEG) covers from its own inventory: the [Wedding Pack's](/packages/wedding/) sound, lighting, microphones and a technician. For the full picture of what we cover for weddings, see our [wedding rentals](/blog/wedding-rentals/) overview.

## Brief Overview

---

A wedding in Malaga typically needs seating and tables, linens, catering, florals and decor, photography and video, and audio visual: sound, lighting, microphones and a technician. Malaga Event Gear's own inventory covers the last category. The [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) covers PA sound for up to 80 guests, fairy light and warm LED ambient lighting, wireless microphones for vows and speeches, and a live technician on site, for 650 euros ex VAT. Everything else on the list, from chairs to catering, usually comes from other vendors or the venue itself.

